OrangeCount
Copyright 2026 OrangeCount contributors

OrangeCount is an independent clean-room implementation of the public
Beancount v3 language and accounting behavior. It does not include or link
to Beancount source code. Beancount is a separate project with its own
license and is used only as an optional development-time compatibility oracle.

